Hi Till,

If we decide to have an FSG Open Printing track 
parallel to the PWG meetings on Thursday/Friday 
6/7 April, then yes, it would be good if you could 
participate.

Since the FSG/OP project has no funds at all, I
wouldn't know anything about possible sponsors.

Note that, as always, the PWG Plenary session will
be available (with presentation slides via FTP) on
a teleconference, even if FSG/OP does not join.  You
might want to attend that way.

